# Text-changing effects are not copied (CR 707.2). Bot1's Sleight of Mind changes Bot2's White Knight to protection from red
# (CR 612.2). Bot1's Clone then enters as a copy of it: the copy has the Knight's printed text, protection from black, with
# first strike (CR 707.2), while Bot2's Knight keeps protection from red.

